│   ├── admin/                     — Design system admin (PageHeader, ListFilterPanel, AdminButton…)
│   ├── layout/                    — Sidebar, TopHeader, DashboardShell, MobileBottomNav
│   ├── common/                    — ImageUploader, OptimizedImage, ListPagination, MediaLibraryModal…
│   ├── products/
│   │   ├── list/                  — ProductListTable, ProductFilterBar, ProductListCard
│   │   ├── form/                  — ProductForm, SkuMatrix, VariationEditor
│   │   ├── preview/               — ProductPreviewView, ProductPreviewWorkspace
│   │   └── shared/                — ProductStatusBadge, ProductPriceBadge…
│   ├── vouchers/                  — VoucherListTable, VoucherForm, VoucherFilterBar…
│   ├── banners/                   — BannerListTable, BannerForm…
│   ├── collections/               — CollectionListTable, CollectionForm…
│   ├── inventory/, customers/, staff/, rbac/, auth/
│
├── lib/
│   ├── api/                       — client.js + entity API (product, banner, collection, discount…)
│   ├── actions/                   — Server Actions + requirePermission()
│   ├── auth/                      — assertPermission, verifyAdminSession, refreshAccessToken…
