│   ├── rbac/                      — navConfig, permissions, routePermissions, getCachedPermissions…
│   ├── products/                  — productSchema, productForm, productDisplay…
│   ├── vouchers/                  — voucherSchema, voucherDisplay…
│   ├── banners/                   — bannerSchema, bannerDisplay, bannerImageSpecs…
│   ├── collections/               — collectionSchema, collectionDisplay…
│   ├── ingredients/               — ingredientSchema, ingredientDisplay…
│   └── staff/                     — staffSchema, staffStatus…
│
├── hooks/
│   ├── useDebounce.js             — useDebounce + useDebouncedCallback
│   ├── useListUrlFilters.js       — filter bar: search draft + URL searchParams
│   ├── useStaffStatusUpdate.js
│   └── README.js
│
├── stores/
│   └── README.js                  — Zustand chỉ khi có client state global thật
│
└── proxy.js                       — Next.js 16 route guard (thay middleware.js)
```

**Quy tắc import `lib/`:**
- Shared: `@/lib/shared/utils`, `@/lib/shared/listPagination`, `@/lib/shared/listTableStyles`
- RBAC: `@/lib/rbac/navConfig`, `@/lib/rbac/permissions`, `@/lib/rbac/resourceCapabilities`
- Domain: `@/lib/banners/bannerSchema`, `@/lib/products/productForm`, `@/lib/vouchers/voucherDisplay`
- **KHÔNG** thêm file flat ở `lib/` root (trừ `api/`, `actions/`, `auth/`).

**Quy tắc import component:**
- Page/feature → `@/components/admin` (không `@/components/ui/button` trực tiếp).
- List module → `*ListTable`, `*FilterBar`, `*ListCard`, `*RowActions`, `*SummaryCard` trong folder domain.

