## V. AUTH & PROXY (Next.js 16)

> File bảo vệ route: **`src/proxy.js`**, export **`proxy`** (không phải `middleware`).

**Hiện tại (đúng chuẩn dự án):**
- Check `admin_token` + `admin_client_id`
- `verifyAdminSession(token, clientId)` → `GET /auth/me/permissions` tipjs (JWT verify phía backend)
- Forward `x-user-client-id`, `x-pathname` cho layout RBAC
- Token invalid → xóa cookie, redirect `/login?session=expired`

**KHÔNG** chỉ check cookie tồn tại. **KHÔNG** bypass RBAC theo `role_type === 'ADMIN'`.

Layout đọc `x-pathname` từ header (Server Component) — không dùng `usePathname()` trong layout guard.

---

## VI. API LAYER

**`lib/api/client.js`** — mọi request admin:
- Server-only: `API_KEY` (`x-api-key`), token (`authorization`), `x-client-id`
- 401 → refresh token một lần → retry; vẫn 401 → redirect login
- 403 account blocked → `session-clear` route
- **Chỉ gọi từ Server Components / Server Actions** — client dùng Server Actions

**Pattern entity** (`lib/api/banner.js`):
```js
export function getBanners(params) {
  const qs = new URLSearchParams(params);
  return apiGet(`/banner?${qs}`, { revalidate: 0 });
}
export function getBannerById(id) { return apiGet(`/banner/${id}`, { revalidate: 0 }); }
```

List admin dùng `revalidate: 0` (data thay đổi thường xuyên). Sau mutation → `revalidatePath` / `revalidateTag` trong Server Action.

---

## VII. CRUD PATTERN — CHUẨN MỌI MODULE

### A. List page (Server Component)
```jsx
// app/(dashboard)/banners/page.js
export const dynamic = 'force-dynamic';

export default async function BannersPage({ searchParams }) {
  const params = await searchParams;
  const permissions = await getCachedMyPermissions();
  const caps = getResourceCapabilities('banner', permissions.grants);

  const [data, statusStats] = await Promise.all([
    getBanners({ page, limit, ...filters }),
    getBannerStats(),
  ]);

  return (
    <>
      <PageHeader title="Banner Hero">
        {caps.canCreate && <PageHeaderAction href="/banners/new">Thêm slide</PageHeaderAction>}
      </PageHeader>
      <BannerFilterBar statusStats={statusStats} />
      <BannerListTable items={data.items} canUpdate={caps.canUpdate} canDelete={caps.canDelete} />
    </>
  );
}
```

Mỗi route quan trọng có `loading.js` + `error.js`.

### B. Server Action (mutation)
```js
'use server';
import { requirePermission } from '@/lib/auth/assertPermission';
import { revalidatePath } from 'next/cache';

export async function createBannerAction(prevState, formData) {
  const denied = await requirePermission('create:any', 'banner');
  if (denied) return denied;

  const parsed = bannerCreateSchema.safeParse(/* … */);
  if (!parsed.success) return { error: parsed.error.flatten().fieldErrors };

  try {
    const banner = await createBanner(parsed.data);
    revalidatePath('/banners');
    redirect(`/banners/${banner._id}`);
  } catch {
    return { error: 'Tạo banner thất bại' }; // không expose lỗi backend
  }
}
```

### C. Form (client)
- `react-hook-form` + `zod` + `useActionState`
- Layout form: `FormCard`, `FormStickyActions` từ `@/components/admin`
- Upload ảnh: `ImageUploader` + validate size (`lib/shared/imageDimensions.js`)

