## XI. CHECKLIST TRƯỚC KHI BẮT ĐẦU MODULE MỚI

1. **tipjs** — model, routes, `grantAccess`, Resource `src_name`
2. **`lib/api/<entity>.js`** + **`lib/<domain>/`** (schema, display, lifecycle)
3. **`lib/actions/<entity>.js`** — mọi mutation có `requirePermission()`
4. **Pages** — `page.js`, `loading.js`, `error.js`, `new`, `[id]`, `[id]/edit`
5. **Components** — copy pattern voucher/banner (VIII)
6. **`navConfig.js`** — `permission.resource` = `src_name`
7. **`routePermissions.js`** — route `/new`, `/edit`
8. **Layout caps** — `getResourceCapabilities` → nút Thêm/Sửa/Xóa + TopHeader props
9. **Form** — zod schema + `useActionState`
10. **RBAC UI** — không gate nút chỉ theo `pathname`
11. **JS only** — không `.ts` / `.tsx` (trừ `components/ui/*.jsx` shadcn)
12. **Tiếng Việt** — label UI

