## XII. DATA MODELS (tóm tắt)

### Product — `lib/products/productSchema.js`
Variations, SKUs, `product_type` (dryseed|milkseed|combo), publish/draft, badge, voucher attach.

### Banner — `lib/banners/bannerSchema.js`
`placement`, `sort_order`, `status` (active|inactive), `image_desktop`, `image_mobile`, link CTA.

### Collection — `lib/collections/collectionSchema.js`
`slug`, `products[]`, `sort_order`, `status` (active|inactive).

### Voucher — `lib/vouchers/voucherSchema.js`
Code, %, scope (products/skus), lifecycle (active|scheduled|expired|inactive).

### Order (dự kiến)
`order_status`: pending|confirmed|shipping|done|cancelled

